099 - God Will Take Care of You
 / 
Key: Bb
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 99
Topic: God the Father - 

Verse 1:
[Bb]Be not dismayed whate'er betide, [F7]God will take care of [Bb]you;
[Bb]Beneath His wings of love abide, [F7]God will take care of [Bb]you.
[Eb]God will take [Bb]care of you, [F7]Through every day, o'er all the [Bb]way;
[Bb]He will take [Eb]care of [D]you, [Eb]God will take [F7]care of [Bb]you.

Refrain:
[Bb]God will [F7]take care [Bb]of you,
[Bb]through every [F7]day, o'er [Bb]all the way;
[Eb]he [Bb]will take [F7]care [Bb]of you,
[Bb]God [Eb]will [D]take [Eb]care [F7]of [Bb]you.

Verse 2:
[Bb]Through days [F7]of toil when [Bb]heart doth fail,
[Bb]God will [F7]take care [Bb]of you;
[Eb]when [Bb]dangers fierce [F7]your [Bb]path assail,
[Bb]God [Eb]will [D]take [Eb]care [F7]of [Bb]you.

Verse 3:
[Bb]All you [F7]may need [Bb]he will provide,
[Bb]God will [F7]take care [Bb]of you;
[Eb]nothing [Bb]you ask [F7]will [Bb]be denied,
[Bb]God [Eb]will [D]take [Eb]care [F7]of [Bb]you.

Verse 4:
[Bb]No matter [F7]what may [Bb]be the test,
[Bb]God will [F7]take care [Bb]of you;
[Eb]lean, [Bb]weary one, [F7]upon [Bb]his breast,
[Bb]God [Eb]will [D]take [Eb]care [F7]of [Bb]you.
